sheet Data
set Data!A1 =Sheet1!A1+B1
set A1 100
set Data!B1 1
set Data!C2 5
copy Data!A1 Data!B2
show Data!B2
get Data!B2
clear Data!B2
get Data!B2
copy Data!B2 Data!C3
copy Data!C2 Data!Z99
get Data!Z99
copy Data!A1 Data!Z99
show Data!Z99
copy Data!A1 Data!A99
show Data!A99
use Data
show A99
get B1
sheets
